DESCRIPTION:The Barr Trail Mountain Race is one of the Front Range's historic summer mountain running events. The 12.6-mile course begins at the Cog Railway Station (6\,570 ft) in Manitou Springs\, Colorado\, ascends Pikes Peak's iconic Barr Trail to Barr Camp (10\,200 ft) before turning\, descending and finishing at the Barr Trailhead.
LOCATION:Cog Railway Station (6\,570 ft) in Manitou Springs\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
